<view class="mail-home" style="padding-top:{{topInset}}px">
 <view class="topbar"><view class="brand"><view class="brand-symbol">✉</view><view><view class="brand-name">灵犀场</view><view class="brand-caption">10 分临时邮箱</view></view></view><button class="icon-button" data-path="/account/notifications" bindtap="open" aria-label="消息与公告">🔔</button><button class="account-button" data-path="/account" bindtap="open">账户</button></view>
 <view class="hero"><view class="hero-kicker"><view class="live-dot"></view> 给常用邮箱留一点清净</view><view class="hero-title"><view>临时收件，</view><view>轻松一点。</view></view><view class="hero-description"><view>注册体验、接收确认邮件。</view><view>临时邮箱与随手工具，都在这里。</view></view><view class="envelope" aria-hidden="true"><view class="envelope-flap"></view><view class="letter"><view class="letter-line"></view><view class="letter-line short"></view></view><view class="envelope-front">✦</view><view class="envelope-badge">10 MIN</view></view><button class="start-button" bindtap="start">打开临时邮箱 <text>↗</text></button><view class="hero-footnote">每天免费 10 个 · 批量 ¥0.05/个</view></view>
 <view class="section-header"><view><view class="section-title">顺手，做好更多事</view><view class="section-caption">图片 · 文档 · 文字 · 隐私</view></view><button class="text-button" data-path="/tools" bindtap="open">全部工具 →</button></view>
 <view class="tool-grid"><button wx:for="{{tools}}" wx:key="path" class="tool-card" data-path="{{item.path}}" bindtap="open"><view class="tool-icon {{item.tone}}">{{item.icon}}</view><view class="tool-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="tool-detail">{{item.detail}}</view></button></view>
 <button class="creative-card" data-path="/sasi?mode=image" bindtap="open"><view class="creative-icon">✧</view><view class="creative-copy"><view class="creative-title">把想象变成图片</view><view class="creative-detail">打开 SASI，连接你的智能服务</view></view><view class="creative-arrow">↗</view></button>
 <view class="section-header"><view class="section-title">你的灵犀场</view></view><view class="link-panel"><button class="link-row" bindtap="mainApp"><view><view class="link-title">主小程序</view><view class="link-detail">更多创作与实用工具</view></view><text>↗</text></button><button class="link-row" bindtap="website"><view><view class="link-title">灵犀场官网</view><view class="link-detail">在这里打开完整网站</view></view><text>→</text></button><button class="link-row" bindtap="orders"><view><view class="link-title">订单与记录</view><view class="link-detail">查看当前登录账户的订单</view></view><text>→</text></button><view class="quick-links"><button bindtap="copyWebsite">复制官网链接</button><button bindtap="recharge">账户充值</button><button data-path="/account/notifications" bindtap="open">消息与公告</button></view></view>
 <view class="closing-note">让小工具，带来一点大方便。<view>LINGXIFIELD</view></view>
 <view class="bottom-nav"><button class="selected" bindtap="start"><text>✉</text>临时邮箱</button><button data-path="/tools" bindtap="open"><text>▦</text>工具箱</button><button data-path="/sasi?mode=image" bindtap="open"><text>✧</text>AI 图片</button><button data-path="/account" bindtap="open"><text>○</text>我的</button></view>
</view>
